`tensordot(\ `:attr:`A`\ `, x, dims=x.ndim) == \ `:attr:`B`.
`x` has shape :attr:`A`\ `[B.ndim:]`.

If :attr:`dims` is specified, :attr:`A` will be reshaped as

.. code:: text

    A = movedim(A, dims, range(len(dims) - A.ndim + 1, 0))

